  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in the hot pot vessel over medium heat.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and saute for 1 minute.",
    "Add the sliced renkon lotus root and cook for 5 minutes or until it starts to crisp.",
    "Add the Norwegian salmon fillets and cook for 3-4 minutes or until they are cooked through.",
    "Add the chopped fresh dill and parsley and stir to combine.",
    "Pour in the vegetable broth and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Stir in the lemon juice and serve hot."
